--
--
A comprehension over range(n) with a bound that is not a conversion-time
constant, whose element expression does not mention the loop variable
(`[[] for _ in range(n)]`), has that value in every slot. Its elements were
nondet, so the "empty" inner lists could be non-empty and every loop over
them stayed open; a stored string slice was punned as in
list-of-empty-lists-inner-type.
